      "text": "a = [1, 4, 3, 2, 9]\nb = [9, 7, 6, 2, 0, 8]\n\nleft = 0\nright = 0\n\nwhile left < a.length and right < b.length:\n    if CONDITION:\n        left = left + 1\n    else:\n        right = right + 1\n\nwhile left < a.length:\n    left = left + 1\n\nwhile right < b.length:\n    right = right + 1",
      "fontSize": 35.99746379929554,
